sequenceDiagram
  actor G as Guest
  participant API as /api/auth/register
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant ML as Mailer (console adapter)
  participant V as /api/auth/verify

  G->>API: name, e-mail, password (min 8, letter + digit)
  API->>PG: fn_register_user(...bcrypt hash...)
  API->>API: random 256-bit token, SHA-256 hash
  API->>PG: fn_create_email_verification(user, hash)
  API->>ML: send link /verify-email?token=...
  API-->>G: 200, signed in, banner "please confirm your e-mail"
  G->>V: token from the link
  V->>PG: fn_verify_email(sha256(token))
  PG-->>V: true once, false when used or older than 24 h
  V-->>G: 200 verified, or 400 invalid link
